          "description": "<p>An arc of lightning leaps from one target to another. You deal electricity damage equal to 1d4 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>",
          "cast": false,
