          "description": "<p>In your mind's eye, you see a path northward. You immediately know which direction is north (if it exists at your current location).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> You can instead know the direction to a familiar location, such as a previous home or a favorite tavern.</p>",
